Z||000000||Matthew_Fiero||09-18-2001||11:59 PM||||I had to re wire my fiero so it is now stock lights, i just colour matched all the wires but the left headlight only goes down and does not come up, i have checked the relay and that is not the problem.  I have 1 wire that is not hooked up, it is a thicker brown wire which is taped into a smaller dark green wire, i have no idea what it does, i may have wired something wrong. But does anyone have any idea why the driver side one works perfectly and the passanger side one only goes down?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Carrolles||09-19-2001||07:42 AM||||What year model car is this?<P>If it is an 84 thru 86 this wiring diagram might help.<BR> <A HREF="http://home.t-online.de/home/u.moeller-objects/schalt15.GIF" TARGET=_blank>http://home.t-online.de/home/u.moeller-objects/schalt15.GIF</A> <P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
